      "side": 1,
      "message": "From the conversation with the author I think that this patch is not targeted upstream yet - indeed there are many proposals and wip implementations of the restricted heap and none is accepted by the community yet.\n\nI fully agree that in case any other implementation gets to upstream, then it would get difficult since we\u0027ll have to revert this and apply the other, or combine those two. Probably it will get much more time before any solution is worked out.\n\nAlso currently we can\u0027t see any other reasonable approach in android16-6.12 branch to handle the restricted heaps properly...",
